{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【TGS2026】「NHN PlayArt」攤位報導！展示包含「OVER RUSH」等新作在內共7款作品！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/eea516a30369c613b35118838e6a2e7f372ebbe9a2381757b311aea0acc8d44b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8b87fc6a726d8280b53a03a32f0e8b33.jpg\"/><p>於 2026年9月17日(四)～20日(日) 4天期間舉辦的遊戲慶典「 東京電玩展2026 (以下稱TGS2026)」 這次要報導「 NHN PlayArt 」攤位！</p><h3>報導「NHN PlayArt」攤位！展示共7款作品！</h3><p>NHN PlayArt攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b810db641b186a57369750e80617e80540f38e1bf5d9f544930e268b5100bd4b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F85ce51f606ddd2b39c64b85f437c19a2.png\"/><p>潛入 睽違8年 參展TGS的NHN PlayArt攤位！ 在NHN PlayArt攤位，可享受包含新作在內共7款作品的展示。</p><h3>#COMPASS 戰鬥攝理解析系統</h3><p>等身大尼德霍格</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/88e91127cd12ca8639b0bdf93f9e0944be804d5fca13cac6878359120d590e51/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8bed171c59e6a1d74f93c0b268e83a81.jpg\"/><p>首先是與「鋼之鍊金術師」聯名而話題沸騰的「 #COMPASS 戰鬥攝理解析系統 」 等身大的「 HM-WA100 尼德霍格 」模型迎接來賓。 其大小從遊戲內其他角色的尺寸逆推，估計約2.5m。 英雄們竟然與這麼大的東西戰鬥嗎・・・！</p><h3>迪士尼TsumTsum</h3><p>可與巨大Tsum拍照的拍照景點</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/66205805ae1d5ea5e73b01b91f62ffe9525954932a5a2af6eeeaf3e3786e6dc3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F714b49a636052670663d83b0b6c34427.png\"/><p>接著是世界累計下載突破1億的「 迪士尼TsumTsum 」區域。 這裡可與米奇們聚集的可愛拍照景點拍照。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/78e25b3872e0a785af11fbaa2d0397b7b6bf35e0a61ecb72d94b396afa212cf9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Faf209e171b0e6e039a8130cc55157b8b.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8e54b7cf8186c93acc13b2e143e08ebc50d179904814872993b9f304dbdf9857/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F3c6feb8b671f8498d70acbad5db5bff5.png\"/><p>更設置了可在大螢幕遊玩的試玩區。 可用 至今登場的全部Tsum ，且 等級・技能等級皆MAX ，以大方的方式遊玩。 既有玩家或許也能嘗試平時無法測試的戰術・・・！</p><h3>妖怪手錶 PUNIPUNI</h3><p>妖怪手錶 PUNIPUNI區域</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5e4c432cfaa9b8640a8199b5746088c8465c9ab80a61b60e572ab79611fce623/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1dac489b7aaa61fbdd1c2b3e8a0b5728.png\"/><p>接著是日本國內下載突破3,600萬的「 妖怪手錶 PUNIPUNI 」區域。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a3a6b7e960998d400bdd05cadd0dc9183e626315a17bf7d35560eea1fc196dd6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F368421744fe0e5788b398ed3f6a4b7bd.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5e23d9aed483aac2b590a2466ab260a7cf73b5024647ee23486fc011785fabab/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc723425a29bbab8c1545fa6e2fd0deae.jpg\"/><p>這裡可以轉「 真實妖怪轉蛋 」。</p><p>夏日兔子的序號</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2e579d0abf75bad5d670072ac7deea6fa93bc243b7c3474c0bbf7edc50640419/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F186d112d9ec285727f59f2c9df011fa5.png\"/><p>轉蛋內容是可在遊戲中使用的序號。 獲得了非常可愛的 夏日兔子 。 此外，也能享受像靈異照片般拍進妖怪的「 心跳妖怪拍照 」。</p><h3>DISSIDIA DUELLUM FINAL FANTASY</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5868adbce21704b50d997b70839b48764d52b025266166204d3c024429debb01/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fa338b46a8bb0c886e38bf4e3fab5ae1c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fa5da513ff79265e14ce19ca57ccb4fb9db246e2eee5874da9d274886415cd6c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F15d7838a7872f281be0c278940c9918b.jpg\"/><p>2026年3月才剛推出的「 DISSIDIA DUELLUM FINAL FANTASY 」立刻展出。 首先映入眼簾的是與本家Final Fantasy不同、現代風服裝的賽菲羅斯與克勞德等身大看板。</p><p>眾多周邊</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4deaf6c511e49385a846e4edc212254ce7762dfc51c0e9217590dd75aba35fe1/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2c810e8868454e80e245a41b2383640c.jpg\"/><p>扭蛋「DISSIDIA DUELLUM FINAL FANTASY×Taito Station」徽章(全16種)</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/f74d06fdb7ba41728bf03fafb43e6cf57f62bb93b7bc00de323d043636c0f1e0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F29ac9bfb4b82f2a36aaf1b7b74429b7c.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e4ae8b154dfb0ceff1c7f60d750222603c787a45549efcd43bcdc9991820d978/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F00ad717530f0f6b6642949c10cc68715.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5a2bb91ab80912ef3a00dc99fe65178e30d73ff97bc7823c20f541cfe0cdeb6f/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1fcf50c5ef8a5c98f204dd7532c3252a.jpg\"/><p>然後排列著眾多周邊，以及歷代「DISSIDIA FINAL FANTASY」的包裝。 PSP的DISSIDIA我可是玩得非常透徹。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cd3b3da6724ab3161ca1fd133035099f05cef5ea61e7db058f58c1b37b918c0c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F52b49d8d5cc7ba8bd6af33ba3b2344f2.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/10541042240d1f88492449cbdae015348ee6701ab07baa8380eb358d402d063e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F5cec554a8e8c76a9f4d8bb16df3f9934.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b4785077ddd5d409edc9bc922a796590d766c4e9bcd170c1dc5e074dee88dc57/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6da39606f17ff73cd2a39c01da37d3d9.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/116cbb8285de00a07483f96cc177f08f5a969a237e5d1cd3e3cf06d445836d3b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F66857c4c46428029c0b98a363ba706ef.jpg\"/><p>在其深處，蒂娜與蓋婭的等身大看板，以及UR技能的插圖齊聚一堂。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8b6d60b0605129c4fce64a02e2b40e8d1e4227909a9b7d21a4f2a2e9b57daf19/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F784766630173a713c60449279ed594ad.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e822455ce5b909cc80d7069dab3cb6487c90bfe89804d0dde5a8d617128dbd9a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F39597951ae99a99d952405e0ec3e61f6.jpg\"/><p>將技能插圖放大後，就是這種感覺。 插圖本身當然不用說，也感受到了DISSIDIA特有的全明星感。</p><p>呵哇呵呵呵呵</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2d1b20fb9b3bdc456668521c6b5e3a6b5411f26d48c335ecc4a025c0fd2d687e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F36d1bc7bc1feb4f2a236006d2f127f63.jpg\"/><p>話說拍攝時，感覺與凱夫卡對上了眼，這應該是錯覺吧。</p><h3>刀劍亂舞PUZZLE</h3><p>刀劍亂舞PUZZLE區域</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/58493c097b1969302c9ffcf9054ed41a3e70a034e967ecc8cf52cc63726fc1f5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fd4de11ce2493aa22cb85cef1443df90c.jpg\"/><p>TGS之後才剛開始推出的新作「 刀劍亂舞PUZZLE 」</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5372a0bdf0c9b2ca843e8e2928bdd4627b43d2f28dba780c383100fff769cef6/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F016e8be196547e91b3dc789a5b994629.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/8c5eaf74ed5501447fa80348a9df22711f36a4d9cd8fec44434b41a07863f823/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F472ca9b634168d09ee1b5c4397fafddd.png\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b990a228b4eeae569fa82b825f563c625f5a9350a4e0f6e4668aad3584eb2d2e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F076d5d048c2886c092eb6dee947e5796.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/07d16ff15c1509c2fec3718e7f0243aed23f5a4ddbb9bd3f7a616b6fddd3b861/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F59a35b7177bb2bf0b49bf8fa478e0951.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/fdf06bc3a8d043d6aced29e0879874352738b3b5cdcf2fa752d7cf22b60debcf/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc7c16ee7ef111fe747a12651d275f118.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1b037367383b0eda4522bb9c381342ea337e5c0dd764ab2ff9101ece535b6e89/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F92b423aae83dac2631f1291462017d58.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/72cc332c3b571debdd0246031578bd0ac18f2bb59171bb468d2032349dc24733/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ffc8b08f72d8bb92b183f4ce2b5a377f2.jpg\"/><p>這裡設置了將遊戲中各種場景截取展示的「繪卷街道」。 遊戲世界飛躍到現實中的體驗，正是實體活動的精髓呢。</p><h3>幻想世界的Puchipoyon(幻想世界のぷちぽよん)</h3><p>幻想世界的Puchipoyon區域</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3d01c0d7252078ae772bfb5fcd2a3eb96994e1a4bad77d8892d35a76b10088c5/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fcfc4b72b1cfc7c0fd01a0ddfdbd4b279.jpg\"/><p>今後預定推出的期待新作「 幻想世界的Puchipoyon 」 本作以攻略益智關卡，讓Puchipoyon們從魔女之館逃獄為目的。 這裡也能試玩遊戲，但是・・・。</p><p>Yunikuma出現！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/427b2a2e0769cb08554f3a066ab123406fb90122c25d07b681eab00bea4fb8d2/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2dda6e78c078d61c188fb8772c3362c8.jpg\"/><p>區域附近出現了Yunikuma。 筆者採訪NHN PlayArt攤位的數十分鐘內，牠總是一直露面。</p><p>「和OVER RUSH擅自聯名中～！」by工作人員</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/d8f1bd21a6318a8a759054e165d31fb6479b0895821816ebcbe6fc43c55ba4d9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F246ca06fd5a068aa524a89dce1211822.png\"/><p>竟然在採訪中，遇到Yunikuma飛出區域，擅自開始與OVER RUSH聯名的場面。 將來或許真的會在遊戲內聯名・・・？</p><p>據說Yunikuma雖然很努力，但常常白忙一場・・・。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dc648304c80e619137325535f6f24e5979c2cac6fe1765cd550c0229bcb700fc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F83433218be3f1704d54b31fdeda08599.jpg\"/><p>然而，或許是走太多太顯眼，稍微移開視線後就被關進牢籠裡了。 請像遊戲本篇一樣，努力逃獄吧・・・！</p><h3>OVER RUSH</h3><p>OVER RUSH區域</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a49f0f499ba50cd39062c7438ea2b332f54364af01c8dafc5ec8d4ed15b78d42/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6226bee7b9750544532eed3000a33764.png\"/><p>這也是今後預定推出的新作「 OVER RUSH 」 TGS期間實施公開β測試，會場也能試玩。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6e6684484bb26238c0361bf044767e5b7728b2d0a71bf4058898e8d13ebfb8ba/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F33f3da806c994d7921d78b3e0d028082.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/361db027d11bc51e829395713f6c820bc48e1dea7c9816e5d71df7b3fa7af071/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fba8b8694db1f53365f81cca95faa18fa.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/1a2870c70fb2a97d2091a52a191df604696c06d4836a485a74d55da70e9a4e28/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F75b95b983122f9f8b7d24ea1d5ced298.jpg\"/><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e24ef066c7565614503217f55887aac94a2467a494fe4e721728587eefe54a20/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F80fd8deb45c9ec94307107f39aa96ffe.jpg\"/><p>不愧是號稱「爆速」高速卡牌對戰RPG，以手機遊戲常見的簡單操作即可連續攻擊，非常爽快。 也期待正式推出！</p><p>以上，就是NHN PlayArt攤位！</p><p>🔸【TGS2026】「AndGAMER」攤位報導！與「鬥陣特攻」的聯名企劃，以及「AIM1」「Void Gaming」等產品登場 🔸【TGS2026】「Pocketpair」攤位報導！展示官方角色扮演者與專業人士打造的「搗蛋貓雕像」等 🔸【TGS2026】Topre「REALFORCE」展位報導！還發現了首度亮相的 Hololive 與寶可夢聯名鍵盤！ 🔸【TGS2026】「Aniplex」展位「FateEXTRA Record」活動報導！舉辦與貓姬的見面會，以及Cosplayer攝影會！ 🔸【TGS2026】「女神異聞錄4 Revival」Enako特別講座＆攝影會報導！DJ特別演唱會＆舞蹈舞台也有</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-06T05:39:02.022250+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1982,"images":40,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}